# FRONTEND

Use Angular 22 (zoneless, no `zone.js`) for cursor-customer-portal.

Requires Node.js `^22.22.3 || ^24.15.0 || >=26.0.0` and TypeScript 6.0.x.

This Angular app consumes **Agent API** (`cursor-node-api`) over HTTP only.

Never connect Angular directly to MySQL or any database.

Never store database information in this repo (credentials, schema, SQL, migrations).

Never duplicate server-side business logic in Angular.

If an endpoint is missing, request Agent API and identify as **Website portal**. Do not invent it here.

Use typed API models/services.

Do not invent endpoints.

Respect API contracts.

Implement loading, empty, error and validation states.

Website must be responsive and mobile-friendly.
